sequenceDiagram
    participant Scheduler as Scheduler
    participant BE as Backend
    participant DB as Database
    participant Device as Perangkat
    participant TG as Telegram API
    participant ChPusat as Channel Monitoring Pusat
    actor NOC as NOC

    Note over Scheduler,NOC: HKN-020: Alert Backup Gagal & Retry Mechanism

    Scheduler->>BE: Trigger backup
    activate BE
    BE->>BE: Init SSH connection (Netmiko)
    BE->>Device: SSH Connect
    activate Device
    Device-->>BE: Connection Failed
    deactivate Device
    
    BE->>BE: Check retry policy
    Note over BE: Config: max_attempts,<br/>delay_interval
    
    loop Retry < Max Attempts
        BE->>BE: Wait delay interval
        Note over BE: Retry Manager logic
        BE->>Device: SSH Connect attempt
        activate Device
        
        alt Koneksi Berhasil
            Device-->>BE: Connected
            deactivate Device
            deactivate BE
            Note over BE: Continue normal backup process
        else Koneksi Masih Gagal
            Device-->>BE: Failed
            deactivate Device
            BE->>BE: Increment retry counter
        end
    end
    
    alt Max Retry Reached
        BE->>DB: Update backup status: FAILED
        activate DB
        DB-->>BE: Status updated
        deactivate DB
        BE->>TG: Send alert notification
        activate TG
        TG->>ChPusat: BACKUP FAILED<br/>Device: {name}<br/>Error: {message}<br/>Attempts: {count}
        activate ChPusat
        deactivate ChPusat
        deactivate TG
        
        Note over NOC: NOC melihat alert di dashboard
        NOC->>NOC: Dashboard menampilkan alert
        
        opt Manual Retry
            NOC->>BE: Klik tombol "Retry Manual"
            activate BE
            BE->>Scheduler: Trigger immediate backup
            activate Scheduler
            Scheduler-->>NOC: Retry dijadwalkan
            deactivate Scheduler
            deactivate BE
        end
        deactivate BE
    end
